Plushie is a lightweight upscaler shader written in GLSL.
==========

Build
-----

Check dependences with "ninja deps".
Build with "ninja".

Usage
-----

Pass these uniforms:
    
    uTex   ->  input texture
    uTexSize  ->  original size (vec2)
    uOutSize  ->  target size (vec2)
    
Optional thresholds (0 = use built-in defaults):
    
    uThreshGradLow, uThreshGradHigh, uThreshVarLow, uThreshVarHigh
    
Getting started
---------------

Use example script to scaling image:

    cd example
    python -m venv .venv
    source .venv/bin/activate # For Unix/Linux/macOS
    .venv\bin\Activate.ps1 # For Windows
    # python -m pip install -r requirements.txt
    python ./scaling.py -o scalied.jpg --shader-dir .. /path/to/your/image.jpg
